{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026enyM6EPIxA1785030594.jpg\"/><p style=\"text-align: left;\">油麻地避風塘，風暴期間有船隻懷疑入水。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">消防船接報後到場處理，警方表示，早上近五點半，油麻地貨物裝卸區對出水域，一艘船報稱入水，船上三人沒即時危險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-26T01:57:56.105799+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":74,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}